REAP for Ascend NPU

This project is derived from the REAP project developed by Cerebras Research:
https://github.com/CerebrasResearch/reap

The upstream project provides the REAP algorithm, research implementation, and
associated documentation. This derivative distribution adapts the observation,
expert-pruning, container, and serving workflows for Ascend NPU environments.

The upstream project and this derivative distribution are provided under the
Apache License 2.0. Third-party models, datasets, drivers, libraries, and
container images remain subject to their respective licenses.
